{"seq":2,"slug":"delivery-guarantee-retry","title":"投递保证与重试策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-webhooks-callbacks/fundamentals/delivery-guarantee-retry","wordCount":1414,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"投递保证与重试策略\">投递保证与重试策略</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Webhook 投递保证的核心问题是如何在不可靠网络上确保事件被消费者成功接收。本文覆盖 at-least-once 语义的工程实现、投递状态机设计、指数退避算法（含抖动）、三层重试模型、超时配置、事件持久化、以及 Dead Letter Queue 策略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"at-least-once-的工程含义\">At-Least-Once 的工程含义</h2><p>在 <a href=\"webhook-architecture-patterns\">Webhook 架构与模式</a> 中我们确认了 exactly-once 投递的不可能性。生产 webhook 系统选择 at-least-once 语义，意味着每一条设计决策都围绕「确保送达、容忍重复」展开。这不仅是理论选择——它直接决定了数据库 schema、队列配置、worker 行为和消费者契约。</p>\n<p>At-least-once 的工程实现要求满足三个条件：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>事件持久化</strong>在投递尝试之前完成（写 DB/队列先于 HTTP POST）</li>\n<li><strong>投递状态</strong>被可靠记录（只有收到明确 2xx 才标记成功）</li>\n<li><strong>失败事件</strong>被重新调度而非丢弃</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"投递状态机\">投递状态机</h2><p>每个 webhook 投递实例经历如下状态转换：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; Pending: 事件入队&#10;    Pending --&gt; Attempting: Worker 取出&#10;    Attempting --&gt; Delivered: 2xx 响应&#10;    Attempting --&gt; Retrying: 5xx/超时/连接失败&#10;    Retrying --&gt; Attempting: 延迟后重试&#10;    Retrying --&gt; Failed: 超过最大重试&#10;    Failed --&gt; DeadLetter: 路由到 DLQ&#10;    Attempting --&gt; Disabled: 410 Gone\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; Pending: 事件入队\n    Pending --&gt; Attempting: Worker 取出\n    Attempting --&gt; Delivered: 2xx 响应\n    Attempting --&gt; Retrying: 5xx/超时/连接失败\n    Retrying --&gt; Attempting: 延迟后重试\n    Retrying --&gt; Failed: 超过最大重试\n    Failed --&gt; DeadLetter: 路由到 DLQ\n    Attempting --&gt; Disabled: 410 Gone</pre><p>关键转换规则：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>响应</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>2xx</td>\n<td>标记 Delivered</td>\n<td>消费者明确确认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4xx（非 429）</td>\n<td>标记 Failed，路由 DLQ</td>\n<td>客户端错误不应重试（URL 错误、认证过期）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>429</td>\n<td>遵循 <code>Retry-After</code> 头</td>\n<td>消费者限流，尊重其速率约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5xx</td>\n<td>进入重试队列</td>\n<td>服务端临时故障</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连接超时</td>\n<td>进入重试队列</td>\n<td>网络不可达</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>410 Gone</td>\n<td>永久禁用端点</td>\n<td>消费者主动移除</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"指数退避与抖动\">指数退避与抖动</h2><p>朴素的固定间隔重试在大规模系统中会造成<strong>惊群效应</strong>（thundering herd）——数千个失败投递在同一秒同时重试，压垮正在恢复的消费者端点。指数退避（exponential backoff）加抖动（jitter）是标准解法：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>delay</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mtext>random</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>jitter</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{delay}} = \\min\\left(t_{\\max},\\ t_{\\text{base}} \\cdot 2^{n-1}\\right) + \\text{random}(0,\\ t_{\\text{jitter}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">delay</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2141em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">random</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">jitter</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 为当前重试次数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{base}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为基础延迟，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为最大延迟上限。</p>\n<h3 id=\"standard-webhooks-推荐调度\">Standard Webhooks 推荐调度</h3><p>Standard Webhooks 规范推荐的重试时间表覆盖约 24 小时：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>重试次数</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n<th>累计等待</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>5 秒</td>\n<td>5 秒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>5 分钟</td>\n<td>~5 分钟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>30 分钟</td>\n<td>~35 分钟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>2 小时</td>\n<td>~2.5 小时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>5 小时</td>\n<td>~7.5 小时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>10 小时</td>\n<td>~17.5 小时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>16 小时</td>\n<td>~33.5 小时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实际系统通常在 5-8 次重试后放弃，总跨度 24-72 小时。超出后事件路由到 Dead Letter Queue（DLQ）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三层重试模型\">三层重试模型</h2><p>Hookdeck（2026）提出的分层重试架构已被行业广泛采纳：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[投递失败] --&gt; B{失败类型}&#10;    B --&gt;|瞬时网络错误| C[Tier 1: 即时重试]&#10;    B --&gt;|5xx 服务端错误| D[Tier 2: 短期退避]&#10;    B --&gt;|持续不可达| E[Tier 3: 长期重试]&#10;    C --&gt;|100-500ms, 2-3次| F{成功?}&#10;    D --&gt;|分钟到小时级| F&#10;    E --&gt;|6h-24h间隔| F&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[标记 Delivered]&#10;    F --&gt;|否, 超限| H[Dead Letter Queue]\">graph TD\n    A[投递失败] --&gt; B{失败类型}\n    B --&gt;|瞬时网络错误| C[Tier 1: 即时重试]\n    B --&gt;|5xx 服务端错误| D[Tier 2: 短期退避]\n    B --&gt;|持续不可达| E[Tier 3: 长期重试]\n    C --&gt;|100-500ms, 2-3次| F{成功?}\n    D --&gt;|分钟到小时级| F\n    E --&gt;|6h-24h间隔| F\n    F --&gt;|是| G[标记 Delivered]\n    F --&gt;|否, 超限| H[Dead Letter Queue]</pre><p><strong>Tier 1 — 即时重试</strong>：捕获瞬时网络抖动（连接重置、DNS 解析超时）。100-500ms 延迟，2-3 次尝试。覆盖约 60% 的首次失败。</p>\n<p><strong>Tier 2 — 短期退避</strong>：处理消费者临时宕机（部署重启、过载恢复）。指数退避从 30 秒到 2 小时，5-7 次尝试。</p>\n<p><strong>Tier 3 — 长期重试</strong>：适应消费者维护窗口（计划内升级、基础设施迁移）。6/12/24 小时间隔，持续 3-7 天。</p>\n<h2 id=\"投递超时与连接管理\">投递超时与连接管理</h2><p>Provider 对每次 HTTP POST 设置的超时时间直接影响吞吐量：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>超时阶段</th>\n<th>推荐值</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>连接超时（connect）</td>\n<td>5 秒</td>\n<td>DNS 解析 + TCP 握手 + TLS 协商</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>响应超时（read）</td>\n<td>15-30 秒</td>\n<td>消费者处理时间上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>总超时（total）</td>\n<td>30 秒</td>\n<td>防止 worker 被单个慢端点长时间占用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键实践：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用连接池（keep-alive）减少 TLS 握手开销</li>\n<li>对同一端点的并发投递设上限（通常 5-10），避免压垮消费者</li>\n<li>超时视为投递失败，进入重试流程</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"事件持久化与投递记录\">事件持久化与投递记录</h2><p>At-least-once 要求事件在投递前已持久化。典型的数据模型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE webhook_events (&#10;  id          UUID PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  type        TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  payload     JSONB NOT NULL,&#10;  created_at  TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT NOW()&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE webhook_deliveries (&#10;  id            UUID PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  event_id      UUID REFERENCES webhook_events(id),&#10;  endpoint_id   UUID NOT NULL,&#10;  status        TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;pending&#39;,&#10;  attempts      INT NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  next_retry_at TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  last_error    TEXT,&#10;  delivered_at  TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  created_at    TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT NOW()&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_deliveries_retry&#10;  ON webhook_deliveries(status, next_retry_at)&#10;  WHERE status IN (&#39;pending&#39;, &#39;retrying&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> webhook_events</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id          UUID </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  payload     JSONB </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOW</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> webhook_deliveries</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id            UUID </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  event_id      UUID </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> webhook_events(id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  endpoint_id   UUID </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pending'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  attempts      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  next_retry_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  last_error    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  delivered_at  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOW</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_deliveries_retry</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> webhook_deliveries(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, next_retry_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pending'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'retrying'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>事件表</strong>与<strong>投递表</strong>分离的设计支持一个事件扇出到多个端点——每个端点独立跟踪投递状态。投递 worker 通过索引 <code>(status, next_retry_at)</code> 高效查询待处理任务。</p>\n<h2 id=\"dead-letter-queue-策略\">Dead Letter Queue 策略</h2><p>DLQ 是重试链的终点，但不是事件的终点。DLQ 中的事件应该：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>可检索</strong> — 按事件类型、端点、失败原因过滤</li>\n<li><strong>可重放</strong> — 一键重新投递到原端点或新端点</li>\n<li><strong>可告警</strong> — DLQ 深度超阈值时通知运维</li>\n<li><strong>有 TTL</strong> — 超过保留期限（通常 30-90 天）自动清理</li>\n</ol>\n<p>消费者自助门户中暴露 DLQ 内容和重放按钮是现代 webhook 平台（Svix、Stripe Dashboard）的标配功能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"投递确认的语义陷阱\">投递确认的语义陷阱</h2><p>消费者返回 2xx 的语义应该是「我已安全接收此事件」，而非「我已完成业务处理」。最佳实践是消费者在将事件入队到内部处理队列后立即返回 200，将耗时的业务逻辑异步执行（参见 <a href=\"../consumer-side/async-processing-queue\">异步处理与队列集成</a>）。</p>\n<p>如果消费者将业务处理放在 200 响应之前，会面临两难：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>处理超时导致 provider 重试 → 重复处理</li>\n<li>为避免超时草率返回 200 → 处理失败但 provider 认为已投递</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这个架构选择是 webhook 系统设计中最常被忽视却影响最大的决策之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>投递保证的工程实现围绕「持久化先于投递、明确确认先于标记成功、失败必入重试」三个不变式展开。指数退避加抖动防止惊群效应，三层重试模型覆盖从瞬时网络抖动到消费者长期维护的全谱系。投递超时的选择直接影响 worker 吞吐量。消费者返回 200 应表示「已安全接收」而非「已处理完毕」——这一语义约定是整个系统正确运行的前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"投递保证与重试策略","id":"投递保证与重试策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"At-Least-Once 的工程含义","id":"at-least-once-的工程含义"},{"level":2,"text":"投递状态机","id":"投递状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"指数退避与抖动","id":"指数退避与抖动"},{"level":3,"text":"Standard Webhooks 推荐调度","id":"standard-webhooks-推荐调度"},{"level":2,"text":"三层重试模型","id":"三层重试模型"},{"level":2,"text":"投递超时与连接管理","id":"投递超时与连接管理"},{"level":2,"text":"事件持久化与投递记录","id":"事件持久化与投递记录"},{"level":2,"text":"Dead Letter Queue 策略","id":"dead-letter-queue-策略"},{"level":2,"text":"投递确认的语义陷阱","id":"投递确认的语义陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Webhook 架构与模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-webhooks-callbacks/fundamentals/webhook-architecture-patterns"},"next":{"title":"Webhook 安全与签名验证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-webhooks-callbacks/fundamentals/webhook-security-verification"}}